le to consume his soul in only 30  minutes but only like a minute or two  after he is trapped tristan breaks out  of the cage of darkness using the power  of goddess magic meanwhile galand is  duking it out with gawain as lancelot  and percival prepared to make their own  mark on the fight up to this point  percival was getting his power mainly  from his friends and party members donny  nussiens and anne but now that he is  allied with the other knights of the  apocalypse and with the holy knights of  leonis against these two chaos demons he  can feel that his new allies are giving  him additional power given the nature of  percival's hope magic this is of course  a big deal galland becomes fixated on  taking out gawain because her magic  smells the same as eskenor's magic  galland of course still bears a huge  grudge against eskanor who not only  defeated him but also humiliated him in  the original 7 deadly sins story since  gawain's strength still can't compare to  escondors galland manages to smash her  into the ground and it looks like he is  about to destroy her but then he begins  second-guessing himself internally his  grudge against eskanor reminded him that  he was once a member of the ten  commandments who served the demon king  even though his current mental  conditioning is telling him that he is  an apostle of chaos who serves the king  of chaos this internal conflict leads  lancelot to realize that galland and  malaskula have been brainwashed and are  being manipulated by king arthur gawain  then gets back to her feet and  demonstrates another one of her  abilities not only is she able to use  teleportation magic on herself and other  people but she can also use it on  objects and she uses it to teleport her  own sword right into galan's abdomen a  shocked galand realizes that someone who  has such advanced offensive spells can't  be an ordinary warrior and this seems to  give further support to the theory that  gawain received special magical training  from an incredibly powerful wizard  possibly even merlin herself gawain  proceeds to nearly cut galland in half  but even that isn't enough to destroy  him however that is when one of  percival's chibi clones shows up enters  galand's body as he is putting it back  together and detonates causing a massive  explosion that completely destroys gland  or at least that's what it looks like  for the moment seriously is there  anything that hope magic can't do this  is just such a crazy versatile ability  anyway with galande out of the way the  focus shifts back to the fight between  tristan and molascula and that is when  we get the big reveal about tristan's  true power and true race during the  battle melascula summons some sort of  creepy monster that seems to be an  artificial fusion of demon clan and  goddess clan souls there is a humanoid  face that is attached to the monster and  it kind of looks like ludo shell but  this entire thing is just a creepy mess  at any rate this monster is resistant to  both goddess and demon attacks and  tristan's attempt to take it out using  ark ends up being completely ineffective  malasula then calls tristan a nephilim  the impure child of a demon and a  goddess mulaskula begins mocking tristan  for his lack of strength in comparison  to his legendary parents but this  doesn't seem to bother tristan at all  and in fact tristan is so giddy and  almost friendly during the battle that  melascula actually becomes annoyed with  him a random fairy then shows up and  interrupts the fight this fairy asks  where the third member of malacca's  party went after their arrival at leonis  but instead of answering malaskula  slices the fairy into pieces  nevertheless when the question was asked  melascula did think to herself that the  other member of the party who appears to  be the knight with the star-shaped visor  that lancelot is searching for was  heading somewhere near the castle that  is enough information for the fairy who  turns out 